# Witchstalker Frenzy counts creatures that attacked "this turn" only. Bot1's Dwarven Trader attacks on turn 3; on turn 4,
# with nothing attacking, Bot1 taps Ruby, Jet, Pearl and a Mountain for the Frenzy ({3}{R}, no reduction):
# a Mountain as the fourth source pays it exactly: the pool is empty (a cost of 3 or 5 would leave mana or fail). It kills Bot2's Aegis Turtle (0/5).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Dwarven Trader
Witchstalker Frenzy
Mountain
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Island
Aegis Turtle
Island x14

